        <p>IN THE KITCHEN IT is a good plan to 'fix'- a separate clay for making fancy cakes and "Sweets" ; it leaves time for experi- ments, which are always interesting A fresh. idea for a simple sweet that is sure to be a success is BLENDED BLANC-MANGE.</p>
        <p>This is an arrangement of two different kinds of blanc-mange, one above the other in the same mould—it loo'.;s most attractive, and inviting. First procure two packets of BIRDS' Blanc-mange Powder in different flavors, 'say Vanilla and Raspberry.</p>
