      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-07-12_WidnesExaminer_art0134" n="art0134">
        <head>BABY DON'T.</head>
        <p>A BABY DON'T.</p>
        <p>Don't worry if your baby is weak on his legs, and doesn't look as though he were going to walk for some time to come. His reluctance to stand up is possibly due to his weight—if he's healthy—so bathe his limbs in salt-and-water twice a day, and allow him just to creep or crawl as he likes. He will walk when the time comes.</p>
