        <p>AUCTIONEER AND VALUER, BEWSEY CHAMBERS, WARRINGTON. Sales by Auction of Freehold and Leasehold Properties, Building Land, Ground Rents, Farming and Trade Stocks, Household Furniture, Stocks, Shares and Debentures. Valuations for Sale, Probate and Mortgage, on reasonable terms.</p>
